# ============================================================================
# ROUTE 31, expanded  (30x14 blocks, buffer 720/1300; vanilla 20x9)
# Source: build31.py -> route31_base.amap; this file = rough.py --seed 4
#   --p 0.6 --scatter 0.04, then meta.py route31
# ============================================================================
# KEPT: the Violet gate on the west edge with the road running east from
#   it; the L-shaped pond north of the road; Dark Cave's mouth in the NE
#   rock face with its sign; ledges and tall grass south of the gate; the
#   opening south to Route 30; the mail Fisher, Wade, Erick, the fruit tree,
#   Potion and Poke Ball.
# ADDED:
#   A longer road (one block, no grass on it) with a T-junction where the
#     Route 30 lane turns south.
#   Two ledge-terraced meadows in the SW (one-way hops south).
#   A fenced orchard between road and meadows: two fruit trees.
#   Erick's wooded grass pocket in the SE, and a hidden glade below it.
#   A rock pile beside the cave path (Rock Smash fodder later).
# CONNECTIONS: S col 18 (steps 36-37) <- Route 30 N exit col 3: offset -15.
#   W edge is forest behind the gate; the gate itself is a warp pair with
#   Violet's 0e block. Vanilla's W connection to Violet (-9) is now only
#   visual and can be re-offset to taste.
# ============================================================================
ref Route31
key g=08 h=09 k=0b i=10 j=11 q=48 w=49 p=4a L=68 J=69 b=6c n=6d M=71 m=72
key !=3c ?=3d @=3e $=3f &=64 +=62 |=60 <=5d >=5e %=61 /=5c
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTLMMMMJTT
TTTTTTTT(^^^)TTTTTTTTTLMMMMJTT
TTTT<*!<[~~~}^^)T,#,,TLMMMMJ$T
TT,,,S,,[~~~~~~]<,*,,TbmCmmn,T
ghT@,,,,,,,,[~~],*,,,o,S.,*,,T
ijk......................,,,,T
TTT======,,qwwwp,,.,,,,,,,,>TT
TTT"""""",,,,,,,,,.?TT|""""TTT
TT,""""""",,,*,,,,.$TT,"""">TT
TT@,""",,,,qwwwp,,.,?,,"""">TT
TT,========,#,,,,,.,$&$,,,,,TT
TT""""""""@""",,#,.,TTT@,*$TTT
TTT"""""&TTT""@@,,.,TTTT,,TTTT
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT.TTTTTTTTTTT
end
exit S 36 27
exit VioletGate 4 10
exit DarkCave 48 7
obj npc 8 9 FisherMail down
obj npc 18 8 Youngster down
obj trainer 10 15 BugCatcherWade left 3
obj trainer 50 16 CooltrainerErick left 3
obj fruit 24 14 FruitTree
obj fruit 28 16 FruitTree2
obj item 54 9 Potion
obj item 6 24 PokeBall
obj hidden 52 22 HiddenGlade
obj sign 11 7 Route31Sign
obj sign 47 9 DarkCaveSign
